# Asset meta data should stay tracked
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta
!/[Pp]ackages/**/*.meta

# Addressables generated files
[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

# Visual Studio / Rider / IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
